  "notes": "NOT INSTALLED: pull with `ollama pull nemotron-3.5-lightning:30b`. Download 19-25GB (32.9B hybrid Mamba MoE (A3B), Q4_K_M default tag), needs ~28GB RAM plus KV cache; fits the 48GB M4 Max. Library context 1M; limit set to 131072 because Ollama sizes context from VRAM (assumes OLLAMA_CONTEXT_LENGTH raised). No independent benchmark found; set 0.4 above nemotron-3-nano as the newer generation. Q4 quantization already accounted for. Latency estimated for M4 Max 48GB by scaling measured gemma4:26b (78 tok/s, ~4B active) by active-weight bytes; not measured. Thinking is on by default: pass think=false for fast answers. Page checked 2026-10-25.",
